// rts/data/units/skai/great_aerie.json: Great Aerie, the Skai Riders mobile HQ carried by giant birds. Part of rts/data/units; read by the data loader (rts/src/Sim/Data) into a UnitDefinition at match start. Every number is a placeholder for playtesting, not a balance decision.
{
  "$schema_version": 1,
